{"bookId":"cp-5","editionId":"48cce4d1d7388361","chapterId":"c0152","paragraphs":[{"id":"pe7ff84b53d64-1","text":"今古河山无定据"},{"id":"p1618cd3f8966-1","text":"画角声中，牧马频来去"},{"id":"p34aa6e7a9cc2-1","text":"满目荒凉谁可语"},{"id":"p5095cf70de17-1","text":"西风吹老丹枫树"},{"id":"pbbeb1e6e6169-1","text":"从前幽怨应无数"},{"id":"pefda1bf5363f-1","text":"铁马金戈，青冢黄昏路"},{"id":"pf59ab360f592-1","text":"一往情深深几许"},{"id":"p5aea36ec39fc-1","text":"深山夕照深秋雨"}]}